{
"start": 4622.88,
"end": 4625.32,
"text": " Do you sometimes despair of human nature?"
},
{
"start": 4629.02,
"end": 4629.3,
"text": "Yes."
},
{
"start": 4631.98,
"end": 4633.56,
"text": "Yes, of course."
},
{
"start": 4633.7,
"end": 4636.08,
"text": "Can you ever do anything that's right?"
},
{
"start": 4637.27,
"end": 4637.44,
"text": "No."
},
{
"start": 4640.13,
"end": 4640.41,
"text": "No."
},
{
"start": 4640.51,
"end": 4641.03,
"text": "No, no, no."
},
{
"start": 4641.57,
"end": 4645.19,
"text": "No matter what you do, there's always somebody that will say something about it."
},
{
"start": 4645.47,
"end": 4647.35,
"text": "They have their opinion in it, you know?"
},
{
"start": 4648.05,
"end": 4651.77,
"text": "No matter what you do, no matter how well"
},
{
"start": 4652.77,
"end": 4654.33,
"text": " how good your intentions are."
},
{
"start": 4654.77,
"end": 4660.46,
"text": "There's always some jerk, some mean-spirited person to try to bring you down."
},
{
"start": 4661.94,
"end": 4666.28,
"text": "And all you want to do is bring some love and some joy, you know?"
},
{
"start": 4667.98,
"end": 4668.5,
"text": "That's all."
},
{
"start": 4672.93,
"end": 4675.95,
